        "Id": "853bb55e-1007-4114-aaed-fbcd4ac191e7",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Pritchard&apos;s poison",
        "Location": "LOCATION_WET_RAT",
        "PublicId": "130620031659",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ea41b988-861d-45f4-9371-4acb5747f2b8).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, agent. A contract has been issued on Angus Pritchard. The client has requested us to eliminate him discreetly, preferably by poisoning his favorite dish. The client has also requested us to make a few of Pritchard&apos;s associates roaming the streets dissapear without a trace. I suggest finding a good vantage point and using a sniper rifle. Eliminate these targets as cleanly as possible, avoiding collateral damage as far as possible.",
